Cute kinetic adventure

Characters: a cute, white, chubby cat and a pink rabbit standing in front of a giant sand sculpture, next to three small black cats. the background is a blue sky, with an old-fashioned steam engine on top of the sculpture. the scene is in a cartoon style, with a 3d rendering. the image is colorful, cute, and high in resolution and detail. the character design is in a chibi style, with a flat illustration. overall, it is of the highest quality.

Motion Concept:

The giant sand sculpture begins to rumble, the old-fashioned steam engine on top comes alive, blowing pastel-colored smoke. The cute white cat and pink rabbit try to keep the three black kittens from falling off the shifting sand platform.
Funny reactions. Big movement. Cute chaos.

